---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
const today = new Date().toLocaleDateString("en-GB");
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy | CoverData" lang="en">
  <main class="container legal">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="update">Last updated: {today}</p>

    <p>
      At <strong>CoverData</strong>, we respect your privacy and are committed to protecting
      your personal data in accordance with Regulation (EU) 2016/679 (GDPR) and other
      applicable data protection laws.
    </p>

    <p>
      This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use and protect your personal data
      when you visit <strong>https://www.cover-data.com</strong>.
    </p>

    <h2>1. Data controller</h2>
    <p>
      <strong>Controller:</strong> Cover Data S.L.<br />
      <strong>Address:</strong> Madrid, Spain<br />
      <strong>Email:</strong>
      <a href="mailto:info@cover-data.com">info@cover-data.com</a>
    </p>

    <h2>2. What personal data we collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Identification data: name, email address, phone number.</li>
      <li>Technical data: IP address, browser type, operating system.</li>
      <li>Usage data: pages visited, time spent on the site.</li>
      <li>Commercial data: preferences if you subscribe to communications.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. How we collect your data</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>When you fill in contact forms.</li>
      <li>When you subscribe to our communications.</li>
      <li>When you browse our website (technical and analytical cookies).</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. Purpose and legal basis</h2>
    <table class="legal-table">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Purpose</th>
          <th>Legal basis</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td>Respond to enquiries</td>
          <td>Consent / Legitimate interest</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Provide services</td>
          <td>Performance of a contract</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Improve the website</td>
          <td>Legitimate interest</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Send communications</td>
          <td>Consent</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Legal compliance</td>
          <td>Legal obligation</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2>5. Data sharing</h2>
    <p>
      We do not sell your data. We may share it with trusted service providers
      (hosting, email, analytics) under confidentiality agreements and in compliance
      with the GDPR.
    </p>

    <h2>6. International data transfers</h2>
    <p>
      Where data is transferred outside the EU, appropriate safeguards such as
      Standard Contractual Clauses will be applied.
    </p>

    <h2>7. Data retention</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Contact data: up to 12 months.</li>
      <li>Marketing data: until you withdraw your consent.</li>
      <li>Legal obligations: as required by law.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>8. Your rights</h2>
    <p>
      You may exercise your rights of access, rectification, erasure, restriction,
      objection, portability and withdraw your consent by contacting
      <a href="mailto:info@cover-data.com">info@cover-data.com</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      You also have the right to lodge a complaint with your data protection authority.
    </p>

    <h2>9. Cookies</h2>
    <p>
      We use cookies for basic functionality, analytics and preferences.
      You can manage them through your browser or the cookie panel.
    </p>

    <h2>10. Security</h2>
    <p>
      We apply appropriate technical and organisational measures to protect your data.
    </p>

    <h2>11. Changes</h2>
    <p>
      This policy may be updated from time to time. The current version will always
      be available on this page.
    </p>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal h1 { font-size: 34px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .update { font-size: 13px; color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .legal h2 { margin-top: 22px; font-size: 20px; }
  .legal p, .legal li { line-height: 1.7; font-size: 15px; color: #334155; }
  .legal ul { margin-left: 18px; }
  .legal-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-top: 10px;
  }
  .legal-table th, .legal-table td {
    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    padding: 8px;
    text-align: left;
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  .legal-table th { background: #f1f5f9; }
</style>

